      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Currently, when mods are leaving for the night, it's a huge deal to close the instance. We have to drop portals, round people up, and eventually kick them. Then we have to watch for an hour to make sure the instance doesn't repopulate. Ideally, we could allow certain group members to change the instance to Group+ or prevent new joins to just let the instance die when all mods are leaving for the night.",
